  m_text: '<color=#00E5FF><b>KVL Steps (6V Series):</b></color>

    1. Place R1
    (100 Ohm) & R2 (200 Ohm) in series slots.

    2. Place Ammeter (series), Voltmeter
    (parallel) & connect wires.

    3. Switch ON 6V Supply.

    4. Click Check
    Circuit -> Record Reading -> Verify Results.

    <color=#FFD54F><b>Next Action:</b>
    Click [3. RECORD READING] to capture observation.</color>'
